      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 900,
        "content": "## Analyze customer feedback and alert negative sentiment with GPT-5.6-luna and Telegram\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives customer feedback through a webhook, validates the input, logs it to Google Sheets, uses an AI agent to classify sentiment, category, score and urgency, and routes action: negative feedback alerts the team on Telegram and emails the manager with an AI-drafted reply suggestion, while other feedback is confirmed to the customer. A weekly digest and a monthly report summarize all feedback and send it to the team.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the webhook URL in your feedback form or app.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and set the target spreadsheet.\n- Connect OpenAI credentials for the sentiment analysis agent.\n- Connect Telegram bot credentials and set the team chat ID.\n- Set the Gmail recipient for escalation emails.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the negative threshold, categories, or the weekly and monthly report schedules to fit your business."
